{"word":"δίκη","uri":"dikê","senses":[{"word":"δίκη","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">δίκη,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ης</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>) [<span class=\"grec\">ῐ</span>] règle,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> usage, manière d’être\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> d’agir : <span class=\"grec\">αὕτη\nδ. ἐστὶ βροτῶν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 218,</span> telle est la manière d’être des mortels ;\n<span class=\"grec\">δίκη βασιλήων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 691 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">γερόντων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">24, 255,</span> coutume des rois, des vieillards ;\n<span class=\"ital\">adv.</span> <span class=\"grec\">δίκην,</span> à\nla manière de, <span class=\"ital\">avec un gén. de\npers. :</span> <span class=\"grec\">δίκην ἀγγέλου,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ch.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">193 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">δ.\nτοξότου,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">705</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, à la façon d’un messager, d’un archer ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec un n. d’animal :</span> <span class=\"grec\">λύκοιο δ.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">P.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 84 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">κυνὸς δ.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ag.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">δ. ὄρνιθος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Phædr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">249</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, à la façon d’un\nloup, d’un chien, d’un oiseau ; <span class=\"ital\">avec un n. de\nchose :</span> <span class=\"grec\">δ. ὕδατος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Sept.</span>\n<sp